01:31:23.116 --> 01:31:27.912
No, that's not what I mean, Helen.


01:31:27.996 --> 01:31:30.871
I don't understand
what you do mean.


01:31:32.749 --> 01:31:34.833
Have I hurt you?


01:31:37.712 --> 01:31:39.880
I didn't mean to.


01:31:41.965 --> 01:31:44.008
